t Opfer eines Rituals und die Frucht, die sie in sich trägt, ist faul, entsprang sie doch des Teufels Lenden.  Und was als Video für das kommende Kind gedacht war, wird Zeugnis wachsenden Horrors…","poster":"/56zW5kl6b10UNIXpQZTUXV2iygC.jpg","runtime":89.0,"title":"Devil's Due - Teufelsbrut","type":"movie","va":4.7,"vc":592,"year":"2014"},"movie:87894":{"cast":[{"id":14481,"name":"Lon Chaney","photo":"/m1icBooBEqFNp24Puu7qXn2Sarr.jpg"},{"id":146141,"name":"Louise Dresser","photo":"/i7NYAqqzY6uhI0IEcwPeYP9tNKt.jpg"},{"id":29973,"name":"Renée Adorée","photo":"/kVVTpFum6WdJg9zJZgeKEYWY5Pu.jpg"},{"id":29600,"name":"Holmes Herbert","photo":"/oCvbtPpsOEdrFLR6be8qkRfOZ3x.jpg"},{"id":47178,"name":"Ralph Forbes","photo":"/kSZ7qzRsQKLlLrNzvwwfsEWZc8B.jpg"},{"id":97993,"name":"Gertrude Olmstead","photo":"/kn4zv0nR4BszOpn4Q0DYUhkN4Bx.jpg"},{"id":1066898,"name":"Mrs. Wong Wing","photo":""},{"id":100346,"name":"Claude King","photo":"/cT60E4qffKqYz8vM44pJdDlLart.jpg"}],"genres":["Drama","Liebesfilm"],"id":87894,"original":"Mr. Wu","overview":"","poster":"/nnTrqMKgHtGuCiGbs28Gu9mKL0g.jpg","runtime":91.0,"title":"Mr. Wu","type":"movie","va":5.8,"vc":22,"year":"1927"},"movie:99318":{"cast":[{"id":14869,"name":"Margaret Sullavan","photo":"/dEZy2AzvB0M1t6lXe1ObZMKALp8.jpg"},{"id":854,"name":"James Stewart","photo":"/3CU3yG3rCTlG3SwxI9iUOzfHtfX.jpg"},{"id":12308,"name":"Walter Pidgeon","photo":"/bzSDciaTy9vshH4Rguyu5elcSR7.jpg"},{"id":11498,"name":"Hattie McDaniel","photo":"/cw4t51HdjPUcry2MRv652t36985.jpg"},{"id":32430,"name":"Nat Pendleton","photo":"/9rZC8qMgJTJ7QYgg6ckXIv8uYRd.jpg"},{"id":83253,"name":"Alan Curtis","photo":"/AfJi9skVbom6EgeqUY76nFjxq1W.jpg"},{"id":14574,"name":"Sam Levene","photo":"/kATWTkWQdPXS0Ry3OfiYrFHEg0L.jpg"},{"id":1209491,"name":"Eleanor Lynn","photo":"/lkh6DpymGikNe8IEWWZkzNZ9XWB.jpg"}],"genres":["Liebesfilm","Drama","Kriegsfilm"],"id":99318,"original":"The Shopworn Angel","overview":"Während er auf seinen Marschbefehl in den Ersten Weltkrieg wartet, verlieb